                            StandardCharsets.UTF_8);
                }
            }
        } catch (IOException e) {
            getLogger().error(
                    "Unable to read theme.json file of theme=" + themeName, e);
        }

        return content != null ? Optional.of(Json.parse(content))
                : Optional.empty();
    }

